<title>UK: Bayer Hypo sets 150 mln Sfr bond.</title>
<headline>Bayer Hypo sets 150 mln Sfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers CSFB and Rud Blass.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN CHF   COUPON     3.0	 MATURITY    16.APR.03</p>
